   1     |;PALASM Design Description
   2     |;---------------------------------- Declaration Segment ------------
   3     |TITLE    BLIZZARD 1260 U11 - DATA PATH LOCAL BUS <-> A1200, EVEN BITS
   4     |PATTERN  U11
   5     |REVISION 0.1 (RECONSTRUCTION)
   6     |AUTHOR   GENERATED BY TOOLS/GEN_DATAPATH.PY, SEE ../ARCHITECTURE.MD
   7     |COMPANY  BLIZZARD 1260 KICAD PROJECT
   8     |DATE     2026-10-26
   9     |CHIP     U11 MACH111
  10     |
  11     |; One registered output per local-bus pin and one combinatorial output per
  12     |; A1200 data pin. Names: Ln = local-bus pin of 060 data bit n (SIMM-Dx on
  13     |; the board, see pins.md), Dn = A1200 data bit n. Byte lanes: lane 0 =
  14     |; bits 31-24, lane 3 = bits 7-0.
  15     |;
  16     |; Controls from U14:
  17     |;   ADOE  (I0)    drive the A1200 bus (writes)
  18     |;   LDOE  (I3)    drive the local bus (reads)
  19     |;   ADOE * LDOE   local mode: lane 0 is an input (EPROM / expansion drives
  20     |;                 it), lanes 1-3 are driven from the registers
  21     |;   LCK01 (CLK0)  latch lanes 0/1: A1200 lanes 0/1, or lane 0 into lane 1
  22     |;                 in local mode
  23     |;   LCK23 (CLK2)  latch lanes 2/3: A1200 lanes 2/3, A1200 lanes 0/1 when
  24     |;                 LDOE is already on (16-bit port, upper word), or in
  25     |;                 local mode lane 0 -> lane 3 and lane 3 -> lane 2.
  26     |;                 During writes its level selects the upper word: A1200
  27     |;                 lanes 0/1 then carry local lanes 2/3 (68020 replication).
  28     |
  29     |;---------------------------------- PIN Declarations ---------------
  30     |PIN  7   D22         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D22 (lane 1)
  31     |PIN  8   D26         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D26 (lane 0)
  32     |PIN  9   D30         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D30 (lane 0)
  33     |PIN  10  ADOE                        ; from U14
  34     |PIN  11  LCK01                       ; from U14
  35     |PIN  14  L2          REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D26 (lane 3)
  36     |PIN  15  L6          REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D29 (lane 3)
  37     |PIN  16  L10         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D13 (lane 2)
  38     |PIN  17  L14         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D15 (lane 2)
  39     |PIN  18  L18         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D21 (lane 1)
  40     |PIN  19  L22         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D17 (lane 1)
  41     |PIN  20  L26         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D2 (lane 0)
  42     |PIN  21  L30         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D6 (lane 0)
  43     |PIN  24  D0          COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D0 (lane 3)
  44     |PIN  25  D4          COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D4 (lane 3)
  45     |PIN  26  D8          COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D8 (lane 2)
  46     |PIN  27  D12         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D12 (lane 2)
  47     |PIN  28  D16         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D16 (lane 1)
  48     |PIN  29  D20         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D20 (lane 1)
  49     |PIN  30  D24         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D24 (lane 0)
  50     |PIN  31  D28         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D28 (lane 0)
  51     |PIN  32  LDOE                        ; from U14
  52     |PIN  33  LCK23                       ; from U14
  53     |PIN  36  L0          REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D25 (lane 3)
  54     |PIN  37  L4          REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D28 (lane 3)
  55     |PIN  38  L8          REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D8 (lane 2)
  56     |PIN  39  L12         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D14 (lane 2)
  57     |PIN  40  L16         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D23 (lane 1)
  58     |PIN  41  L20         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D19 (lane 1)
  59     |PIN  42  L24         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D0 (lane 0)
  60     |PIN  43  L28         REGISTERED      ; local bus SIMM-D4 (lane 0)
  61     |PIN  2   D2          COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D2 (lane 3)
  62     |PIN  3   D6          COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D6 (lane 3)
  63     |PIN  4   D10         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D10 (lane 2)
  64     |PIN  5   D14         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D14 (lane 2)
  65     |PIN  6   D18         COMBINATORIAL   ; A1200 D18 (lane 1)
  66     |
